                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Soul</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="flow-node__menu-item" data-panel="model" aria-pressed="false" title="Model — what do I think with: the selected language model and provider">
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-icon" aria-hidden="true">🤖</span>
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Model</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="flow-node__menu-item" data-panel="thinking" aria-pressed="false" title="Thinking — how deep do I think: reasoning level, thinking budget and related parameters">
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧠</span>
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Thinking</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="flow-node__menu-item" data-panel="tools" aria-pressed="false" title="Tools — what can I do: available built-in and connected tools for taking actions">
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧰</span>
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Tools</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="flow-node__menu-item" data-panel="skills" aria-pressed="false" title="Skills — what special abilities do I have: sets of instructions and skills for particular tasks">
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎓</span>
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Skills</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="flow-node__menu-item" data-panel="agents" aria-pressed="false" title="Agents — which other agents can I call in: available subagents and the rules for using them">
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-icon" aria-hidden="true">👥</span>
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Agents</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="flow-node__menu-item" data-panel="memory" aria-pressed="false" title="Memory — what do I remember: kept context, facts, preferences and accumulated knowledge between sessions">
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-icon" aria-hidden="true">💾</span>
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Memory</span>
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="flow-node__menu-item" data-panel="permissions" aria-pressed="false" title="Permissions — what am I allowed to do: limits and access policy to files, shell, network, outside actions and other resources">
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔐</span>
                                    <span class="flow-node__menu-label">Permissions</span>
                                </button>
                            </nav>
                            <div class="flow-node__main">
